File Index

/useAuthCallback.ts
Purpose: Phase D — on mount, reads window.location.hash for the game-sso hand-off's result (features/auth/authFragment.ts's parseAuthFragment), stores a successful token via authTokenStore, then strips the fragment via history.replaceState so it never lingers in browser history. No router exists in this app, so this runs as a plain effect from MainContainer rather than a dedicated callback route. NOT the live path since the popup rewrite (2026-07-31) — src/auth-callback.ts handles the hand-off now. Kept as the safety net for a hand-off whose returnUrl still points at the app itself: an attempt already in flight across the deploy, or an old bookmarked link. Do not "clean up" without checking for those.

/useAccountModal.ts
Purpose: Phase D — Account modal's state/actions: login (awaits gameSso.startLogin's popup and maps its LoginOutcome to a status line, with its own `loginPending` flag kept separate from `busy` so the cloud buttons aren't affected; a subscribeToToken subscription flips isLoggedIn the moment the popup writes, since nothing in this window re-runs on its own), logout (local token clear only), and save/load-to-cloud for the CURRENT connection's scripts + plugins via cloudSync.ts. Save reads through UserScriptRuntime's public loadScriptsFromStorage/getStorageKey (no private-API reach); Load writes localStorage directly for both scripts and the global plugins key, then does a full page reload rather than trying to live-patch every derived runtime/plugin-host state — deliberately simpler and safer for a destructive, user-confirmed action.
